! mcp_bootstrap_p362.strap -- MCP printed page 362: the SYSTEM COMMAND
! package (PUNID 22SCOMD) continued: the entry JCOMD -- save the index
! registers, fetch message length/address and source code, build the
! mode mask JXMSK from SYSMOD and the source code (a multiway branch at
! ZTSTSR), then ZCMCRD tests the first field for COMD, ZLOKUP / ZLOOK4
! look the command up in JLIST and branch through JTABL; ZBKBCD moves
! broken fields to JFLDB; ZIQS calls SIQSA6 to convert to IQS.
! Lines 1-54.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.112, read at 400 dpi, names at 900
! dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22SCOMD  CARD ID
! WA000041  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 362".  The heading row's
! LOCATION field is BLANK (line 1 is a remark card, as the rule says).
!
! THE PAGE.  54 lines; every line number prints a "*".  "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 17 and 39.  No TAIL, no SLC, no new PUNID: still
! SCOMD, card series WA.
!   lines 1-3    remark cards (banner "*****SYSTEM COMMAND ROUTINE*****"
!                on 2; 1 and 3 blank).
!   lines 4-54   code, contiguous 234443.00 .. 234476.40 (line 54, a
!                half word; next 234477.00).
!
! JOIN.  p.361 ends JTABL at 234442.40, next 234443.00: this page's
! line 4 prints 234443.00 -- contiguous.  p.363's line 1 (Vision) is
! "ZBCD KCI,14,80.0" at 234477.00, the address this page's B,ZBCD
! (line 30) prints -- contiguous.  CARD ID WA000041 follows p.361's
! last serial WA000039, so WA000040 prints on neither page.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  WA000041 .. WA000087 over 54 lines: SEVEN serials are
! printed twice, each on a V+I / B pair: lines 14-15 (WA000054), 16-17
! (55), 18-19 (56), 23-24 (60), 25-26 (61), 27-28 (62), 29-30 (63).
! None skipped.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 4 label "J CDMD" = JCOMD (worn D stems; p.269's stand-in and
!     C22-6728-1 "JCOMD (Figure 56)").
!   * line 28 "B,Z IGS" (a G-like glyph at 900 dpi) = ZIQS: the B prints
!     234472.50, line 46's ZIQS (234472.40) + .10; line 46 prints IQS
!     with a Q tail; C22-6728-1 Fig. 56 "CONVERT IQS"; no ZIGS anywhere.
!   * line 48 "BD,SIQSA6" (Vision SIGSAG): landed p.259 SIQSA6, printed
!     230506.04 = 230506.00 + BD bits.
!   * line 11 "SYSMCD" (open O) = SYSMOD (landed p.103; 215001.10).
!   * "MCDE" (line 11 remark), "J CF"/"J CV" on p.363 = JOF/JOV: O open.
!   * lines 13, 22 "0.0", "-1.0": open rounds in octal-only context.
!   * line 24 prints "234471.1C CO" = 234471.10 00 (open 0s in an
!     octal field and the byte; B,ZBKBCD can only give .10 00, as line
!     26 prints; lesson 6).  Lines 21 (BZXE) and 33 (BZAE) print a real
!     C0, which the statements assemble to.
!   * p.363's "DRZ,(12)" (JFLDB) has no dds: strap_asm raises IndexError
!     on it (statement_size, parse_dds of an empty mods list) -- the
!     stand-in here is a plain SYN.
!
! EXTERNALS.  SYSMOD (p.103), SIQSA6 (p.259), PMCPBF (p.137), JCODE /
! JFRST / JSIZE (p.295), JLIST / JTABL (p.361, SCOMD).  ZEREX1 is on
! no page read yet (plain SYN from this page's binary).  Everything else
! is defined on p.363 (being transcribed in parallel, not landed): the
! stand-ins copy p.363's DEFINING form as I read it off p.363's image
! (PDF p.113, lines 29-53) -- the SYN-defined index names and mode-mask
! bits are written exactly as p.363 prints them (no split guessed: e.g.
! JOV+JON prints 000240 = 32+128); the storage labels carry p.363's
! dds at p.363's printed locations.  The p.363 instruction labels
! (ZBCD, ZBCD9, ZMODER, JERRX, Vision reading of p.363) and ZBRKAD (a
! VF) are cross-checked against this page's binary, half word only.

SYSMOD  SYN(BU,2), (8)215001.10      ! landed p.103 line 18 SYN(BU,2),SCOMRG+.8; L line 11 prints 215001.10
SIQSA6  SYN(BU,64,8), (8)230506.0    ! landed p.259 line 6 TI (full word) at 230506.00; BD line 48 230506.04
PMCPBF  SYN, (8)216775.0             ! landed p.137 line 22 DR(BU,64),(13); VF line 49 PMCPBF+3.0 = 217000.00
JCODE   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)232720.0    ! landed p.295 line 26 ",0" at 232720.00 (half word); LX line 8 232720.06
JFRST   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)232720.40   ! landed p.295 line 27 ",0" at 232720.40; LV line 6 232720.74
JSIZE   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)232721.0    ! landed p.295 line 28 ",0" at 232721.00; LC line 5 232721.34
JX1     SYN,$X1                      ! p.363 line 36 (not landed), as printed there; LX line 37 j=1
JX2     SYN,$X2                      ! p.363 line 37; LVI line 38 j=2
ZSORCE  SYN,$3                       ! p.363 line 38 (prints 000023.00); LX line 8 j=3
ZSMODE  SYN,$X4                      ! p.363 line 39; LV line 12 j=4
JXMSK   SYN,$X13                     ! p.363 line 40 -MODE MASK INDEX; LVI line 7 j=13
JOP     SYN,2.0                      ! p.363 line 44 -OPERATOR IS SOURCE
JSR     SYN,4.0                      ! p.363 line 45 -SPOOL READER
JJ1     SYN,8.0                      ! p.363 line 46 -JOB CONTROL I
JJ4     SYN,16.0                     ! p.363 line 47 -JOB CONTROL IV
JOV     SYN,32.0                     ! p.363 line 48 "J CV" -OVER-LAPPED
JNV     SYN,64.0                     ! p.363 line 49 -NOT OVER-LAPPED
JON     SYN,128.0                    ! p.363 line 50 -ON LINE
JOF     SYN,256.0                    ! p.363 line 51 "J CF" -OFF-LINE
ZIPL    SYN,512.0                    ! p.363 line 52 -IPL IS THE SOURCE
JCN     SYN,1024.0                   ! p.363 line 53 -CONSOLE
ZBCD    SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234477.0    ! p.363 line 1 KCI at 234477.00 (Vision); B line 30 234477.10, half word only
ZBCD9   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234501.40   ! p.363 line 6 SC at 234501.40 (Vision); BE line 54 234501.40
ZBRKAD  SYN(B,25,1), (8)234503.0     ! p.363 line 9 VF at 234503.00 (Vision); SV line 53 234503.35
ZMODER  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234507.0    ! p.363 line 17 LX at 234507.00 (Vision); BZXE line 21 234507.32
JERRX   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234517.0    ! p.363 line 22 LX at 234517.00 (Vision); BXH line 10 234517.33
ZMAIN1  SYN(BU,48,6), (8)234527.0    ! p.363 line 29 (A*)DD(BU,48,6),COMD at 234527.00; L(U) line 31 234527.40
JSTLR   SYN(BU,64), (8)234530.0      ! p.363 line 31 DR(BU,64),(16) at 234530.00; TI line 4 234530.00
JCBUF   SYN(BU,6), (8)234550.0       ! p.363 line 32 DR(BU,6),(80) at 234550.00; VF line 51 234550.00+
JFLDB   SYN, (8)234560.0             ! p.363 line 33 DRZ,(12) at 234560.00; KF line 32 234560.00
JJX1    SYN(BU), (8)234574.0         ! p.363 line 34 XW,0.0,12 at 234574.00; LX line 37 234574.02
JFLDC   SYN(BU,18), (8)234575.0      ! p.363 line 35 CF,0 at 234575.00; SC line 34 234575.35
JLIST   SYN(BU,48,6), (8)234424.0            ! p.361 line 13 (A*)DD(BU,48,6) at 234424.00; LVI line 38 234424.05
ZEREX1  SYN, (8)234631.0             ! not landed (not on p.363); B line 43 234631.10, half word only
JTABL   SYN(BU,32,8), (8)234435.0    ! p.361 line 28 B at 234435.00; BAE line 41 234435.36

        SLC, (8)234443.0             ! p.361 ends 234442.40; line 4 prints 234443.00
! line  1  -
! line  2  -     *****SYSTEM COMMAND ROUTINE*****
! line  3  -
JCOMD   TI,16,$X0,JSTLR                                      ! line  4  -SAVE INDEX REGISTERS
        LC,14,JSIZE                                          ! line  5  -GET MESSAGE LENGTH
        LV,14,JFRST                                          ! line  6  -GET ADDR OF MESSAGE
        LVI,JXMSK,0.0                                        ! line  7  -SET MASK TO ZERO
        LX,ZSORCE,JCODE                                      ! line  8  -GET SOURCE CODE
        KVI,ZSORCE,4.0                                       ! line  9
        BXH,JERRX                                            ! line 10  -BRANCH IF SOURCE CODE IN ERROR
        L(BU,2),SYSMOD,-18                                   ! line 11  -GET SYSTEM MODE BITS
        LV,ZSMODE,$L                                         ! line 12
        BR,0.0(ZSMODE)                                       ! line 13
        V+I,JXMSK,JOV+JON                                    ! line 14
        B,ZTSTSR                                             ! line 15
        V+I,JXMSK,JOV+JOF                                    ! line 16
        B,ZTSTSR                                             ! line 17 *
        V+I,JXMSK,JNV+JON                                    ! line 18
        B,ZTSTSR                                             ! line 19
        V+I,JXMSK,JNV+JOF                                    ! line 20
        BZXE,ZMODER                                          ! line 21  -BRANCH TO ERR IF IPL NOT SOURCE
ZTSTSR  BR,-1.0(ZSORCE)                                      ! line 22
        V+I,JXMSK,JJ1+JSR                                    ! line 23
        B,ZBKBCD                                             ! line 24
        V+I,JXMSK,JJ4+JSR                                    ! line 25
        B,ZBKBCD                                             ! line 26
        V+I,JXMSK,JCN+JOP                                    ! line 27
        B,ZIQS                                               ! line 28  printed "Z IGS"
        V+I,JXMSK,ZIPL                                       ! line 29
        B,ZBCD                                               ! line 30
ZCMCRD  L(U),ZMAIN1                                          ! line 31
        KF(BU,48,6),JFLDB,-48                                ! line 32
        BZAE,ZEREX1                                          ! line 33
ZLOKUP  SC,14,JFLDC                                          ! line 34
        KCI,14,2.0                                           ! line 35
        BXL,ZEREX1                                           ! line 36  -NO COMMAND FIELDS
        LX,JX1,JJX1                                          ! line 37
        LVI,JX2,JLIST                                        ! line 38
        L(U),JFLDB+1.0                                       ! line 39 *  -CALL OP FIELD
ZLOOK4  KF(V+I)(BU,48,6),.48(JX2),80                         ! line 40
        BAE,JTABL(JX1)                                       ! line 41
        CBH,JX1,ZLOOK4                                       ! line 42
        B,ZEREX1                                             ! line 43
ZBKBCD  T,$14,0.0($14),JFLDB                                 ! line 44  -MOVE BROKEN FIELDS TO BUFFER
        B,ZLOKUP                                             ! line 45
ZIQS    SC,14,ZIQSCT                                         ! line 46
        LVI,15,$+1.0                                         ! line 47
        BD,SIQSA6                                            ! line 48
        VF,PMCPBF+3.0                                        ! line 49
ZIQSCT  CF,0.0                                               ! line 50
        VF,JCBUF                                             ! line 51
        LVI,14,JCBUF                                         ! line 52
        SV,14,ZBRKAD                                         ! line 53
        BE,ZBCD9                                             ! line 54

!SYM JCOMD  234443.00
!SYM ZTSTSR 234455.00
!SYM ZCMCRD 234461.40
!SYM ZLOKUP 234463.40
!SYM ZLOOK4 234466.40
!SYM ZBKBCD 234471.00
!SYM ZIQS   234472.40
!SYM ZIQSCT 234474.40
